Specifically, `src/theme.ts` reimplements the OSC 11 background query, its reply
grammar, and the luminance threshold from Hunk's `src/core/theme/detection.ts`.
This is deliberate: it makes this extension classify a terminal background the
same way Hunk's built-in `theme = "auto"` does, so the two never disagree about
the same terminal. The surrounding I/O wrapper adds extension-specific safeguards,
including a bounded reply buffer and terminal-state restoration.
